      "position": 1,
      "question_id": "spacex-public-01",
      "question": "Using FY2025 Connectivity segment figures, calculate YoY growth in revenue, operating income, and Segment Adjusted EBITDA. What do the differential growth rates imply about operating leverage within Connectivity?",
      "question_sha256": "36ce1e3b97c8497546a308c27a049331187555adb0e5286bdd343d3ef56f39f9"
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "question_id": "spacex-public-02",
      "question": "Estimate implied monthly Starlink ARPU using Q1 2026 Connectivity revenue and disclosed subscriber counts. State all assumptions and identify what the filing’s subscriber and revenue definitions exclude from this ARPU estimate.",
      "question_sha256": "774b8d99ae4f00fa2f9f4dde119080d6bec450bb1a39baf1f4a24a0c056349ea"
    },
    {
      "position": 5,
      "question_id": "spacex-public-05",
      "question": "The Space segment absorbed $3,004M of Starship R&D in FY2025 against $4,086M of segment revenue. If that Starship R&D were treated as an unallocated corporate expense instead of segment expense, what would Space Segment Adjusted EBITDA be? What does this indicate about segment-level profitability presentation?",
      "question_sha256": "2f1644e7303c2e1464385178195cc0278d0b68c8d8efb5696a9d19f2765a1e62"
    },
    {
      "position": 9,
      "question_id": "spacex-public-09",
      "question": "The filing defines MAU and daily posts separately. What specific caveat accompanies each metric, and what do the caveats imply regarding the reliability and interpretability of AI engagement metrics?",
      "question_sha256": "d788955dab172d9a9e6d99d327b785413c2f7c947d9f3c65ebd92d2fe3472dd8"
    },
    {
      "position": 12,
      "question_id": "spacex-public-12",
      "question": "As of March 31, 2026, 117M of 550M MAUs used Grok AI features and approximately 350M daily posts were generated. Using these figures and the filing’s metric caveats, what can and can an analyst not conclude regarding Grok’s distribution advantage through X?",
      "question_sha256": "cf4b801b35325a3509eedf01fa23a5d99e68a1419fb7595147fd6ec1889a0fbb"
    },
    {
      "position": 16,
      "question_id": "spacex-public-16",
      "question": "The preliminary filing omits IPO price range and final share count. Which of the following can be determined from the filing as filed and which require amendment disclosure: (i) post-IPO fully diluted share count, (ii) Class A versus Class B economic ownership, and (iii) Musk’s post-IPO voting control?",
      "question_sha256": "02162f4acebd8b2c3b5d6b7929b0f09e16d9452897a4af5864f8149499cffd8a"
    },
    {
      "position": 18,
      "question_id": "spacex-public-18",
      "question": "Using FY2025 Connectivity Segment Adjusted EBITDA and operating income, calculate the implied EBITDA-to-operating-income gap. Why is satellite depreciation economically recurring even though excluded from Adjusted EBITDA?",
      "question_sha256": "79a988b2391c7a081ee874f3f5a0da47960c49301f5a826ea05bc493669786fe"
    },
    {
      "position": 19,
      "question_id": "spacex-public-19",
      "question": "The xAI merger became effective February 2, 2026 and the X merger March 28, 2025. For how many months of FY2025 was each entity included on an actual-close basis, and what analytical challenge does retrospective recast accounting create?",
      "question_sha256": "e11c6abd513492f69cd81dd1bb75245922338d2ac078fae5aceec83d119766d8"
    },
    {
      "position": 25,
      "question_id": "spacex-public-25",
      "question": "Connectivity revenue represented what percentage of consolidated Q1 2026 revenue? Separately, how many quarters of current Starship R&D spending would equal one year of FY2025 Connectivity capex? Which metric better captures cross-segment dependency?",
      "question_sha256": "459a4fdd942705c898cafe366059d3c2d530c201ca84b84ba0c98c1c9d802e3e"
    },
    {
      "position": 29,
      "question_id": "spacex-public-29",
      "question": "Using FY2025 Segment Adjusted EBITDA for Space, Connectivity, and AI, construct a sum-of-parts valuation framework using reasonable public-market comparable categories. Which segment creates the greatest comparable-selection ambiguity and why?",
      "question_sha256": "48380a549cf5ee19bee042dac85fccf604300abfc5b168e8fbf6ee54870949e1"
    },
    {
      "position": 35,
      "question_id": "spacex-public-35",
      "question": "The filing discloses Grok feature usage and MAU penetration but not standalone AI customer counts. What monetization pathways are implied by this disclosure design, and how might embedded distribution through X differ strategically from standalone AI subscription businesses?",
      "question_sha256": "c82ccdd28d93da7ef3ee6974932994344592d4336bde4d18b536daf8d7de5537"
    },
    {
      "position": 46,
